1
00:01:46,039 --> 00:01:46,640
Ningning.

2
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,800
They are from the Huo family.

3
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:48,520
Don't worry.

4
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,520
Protect yourself.

5
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,120
Shi'an.

6
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,800
Take Siyao and go quickly.

7
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,920
Take her and go first.

8
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,780
I'll cover you.

9
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:54,660
Shi'an.

10
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:55,680
Take them and go first.

11
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,880
Lin Jinwen and I will stay.

12
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:57,360
No.

13
00:01:57,479 --> 00:01:57,920
Siyao.

14
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,360
I have another purpose for being here.

15
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,680
Rule number three of our agreement:

16
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,160
Take them away immediately.

17
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:02,560
Okay.

18
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:03,720
Go.

19
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:04,940
Go quickly.

20
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,120
Go.

21
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,880
Go, go quickly.

22
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,440
Hurry up.

23
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:15,740
Come on, get in the car.

24
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:17,120
Hurry, get in the car.

25
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,300
Take them away.

26
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:20,680
Leave it to me.

27
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:22,640
Young Master.

28
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,300
We're here.

29
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:23,960
Good.

30
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:24,720
Brothers.

31
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,600
My father died

32
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:26,640
at the San Faci Winery.

33
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:27,240
Come on.

34
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,720
Charge in with me.

35
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:29,760
Go.

36
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:32,640
Lin Jinwen.

37
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,680
Don't let them escape.

38
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,810
Especially Thomas.

39
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,360
Lin Jinwen.

40
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,600
Jinwen.

41
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,480
Go, go.

42
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,920
Hurry, hurry.

43
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,040
It's all over.

44
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,740
Catch up with them.

45
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:24,200
Siyao.

46
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:25,640
Wake up.

47
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:32,960
Zhou Wei.

48
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,760
Zhou Wei.

49
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:38,200
Huo Qishan.

50
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:41,920
I know you are the real culprit behind the smuggling.

51
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:43,280
Even the Satanic Society

52
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,280
exists under your indulgence

53
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,520
and tacit approval.

54
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,000
Tell me,

55
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:50,240
why did you become like this?

56
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:51,800
For money,

57
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,560
for power,

58
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,800
for the entire Huo family.

59
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,640
You are still young.

60
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,520
You don't understand.

61
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,680
Then do those lives not matter?

62
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,080
The Huo family's status is the most important.

63
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,480
The Huo family's status?

64
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,520
I think it's just your own selfish desires.

65
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,320
Sir.

66
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,760
Sir, bad news.

67
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,570
The St. Faci operation failed.

68
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,080
That kid Lei Zijun

69
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,600
took all the accounts.

70
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,640
They were all handed over to the police.

71
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,839
Now Huang Xianzhong

72
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,680
has sent people to arrest you.

73
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:21,370
What are you panicking for?

74
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,720
Arrest me?

75
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,480
Let's go.

76
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,780
I will absolutely not go with you.

77
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:39,000
I know you have feelings for this kid.

78
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,260
If you don't come with me, I'll shoot him.

79
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,640
Don't worry about me.

80
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,240
If you leave, there's really no turning back.

81
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,240
I'll go with you.

82
00:04:47,159 --> 00:04:47,840
Let him go.

83
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,640
Ningning, don't!

84
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:51,760
Don't go!

85
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:54,140
Once we are safely out of the city,

86
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:56,820
I'll let him go.

87
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,720
Huo Qishan,

88
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,240
come back here!

89
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:02,920
Ningning.

90
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,480
Why did you...

91
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:07,040
Because he is my dad.

92
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:10,040
I can't just leave him.

93
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,130
You will be fine.

94
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,380
Don't scare me.

95
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,720
It's okay.

96
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:33,800
Please,

97
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,600
Reporter Sun.

98
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:37,320
Don't worry.

99
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:39,120
Even if I have to risk my life this time,

100
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:41,980
I will never let the truth sink into oblivion again.

101
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:50,200
You're awake.

102
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,280
I want to go to Shengfaxi Winery.

103
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,320
Okay.

104
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,410
I'll go with you.

105
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,840
Down with the foreigners!

106
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,280
Give us justice!

107
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,960
Down with the foreigners!

108
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,640
Give us justice!

109
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:09,280
Down with the foreigners!

110
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:10,320
Give us justice!

111
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:11,580
What's this nonsense?

112
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,450
Arrest them!

113
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,400
Give us justice!

114
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:27,160
Commissioner Huang.

115
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,600
What are you doing?

116
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,400
Mayor Zeng,

117
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,040
you have been dismissed.

118
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,680
Please cooperate with the investigation.

119
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,480
Take him away.

120
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,380
Down with the foreigners!

121
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,920
Give us justice!

122
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,500
Down with the foreigners!

123
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:44,320
Give us justice!

124
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,900
Down with the foreigners!

125
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,480
Give us justice!

126
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,440
Down with the foreigners!

127
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,840
Give us justice!

128
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,520
Down with the foreigners!

129
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,760
Give us justice!

130
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,680
Commissioner Huang.

131
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,600
Why are you here?

132
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,680
You didn't even notify me in advance.

133
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,040
This way.

134
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:02,600
Have some tea.

135
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,800
I'm not here for tea.

136
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,660
Then what are you here for?

137
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,400
To catch a lackey.

138
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:22,580
Your brothers from Xinfeng Stronghold should all be here.

139
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:37,040
Dad.

140
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,540
Brothers of Xinfeng Stronghold,

141
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,530
Shi'an has avenged you.

142
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,880
For so many years, your wronged souls

143
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,409
have been lingering above.

144
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:50,480
Now your grievances have finally been redressed.

145
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,760
Rest in peace.

146
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,640
Marshal Duan,

147
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:57,440
brothers,

148
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,560
rest in peace.

149
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,040
Nephew,

150
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,000
Back then, Marshal Duan

151
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,440
refused to cooperate with them,

152
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,400
which is why he was murdered.

153
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,960
That night, before he came to the winery,

154
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,960
he sent someone with a letter for me.

155
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,210
He said that in this matter,

156
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:17,120
he would either succeed or die trying.

157
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:20,400
He also instructed me to tell you and your mother

158
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,280
that if he died,

159
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:23,760
you should

160
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:24,820
leave Phoenix City

161
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,520
and never come back.

162
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,400
Marshal Duan

163
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,820
was open and aboveboard all his life.

164
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:33,640
Even when facing the scum of the Satan Society,

165
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,100
he still wanted

166
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,520
to try peaceful means before resorting to force.

167
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,240
Who knew

168
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,240
he would be murdered?

169
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:41,000
Sir!

170
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:42,370
Huo Qishan has escaped.

171
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,400
Don't move.

172
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,880
Don't move!

173
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:54,520
Where are they?

174
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,480
Huo Qishan is taking Ningning to the UK.

175
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,280
To the UK?

176
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,320
Did he tell you that?

177
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:58,800
Yes.

178
00:08:59,080 --> 00:08:59,880
After them!

179
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,680
No.

180
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,040
He said he was going to the UK,

181
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,970
probably to divert our attention.

182
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:24,840
Mr. Li,

183
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:26,320
please help me mobilize all the drivers

184
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,880
to look for these two people.

185
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:28,610
Understood.

186
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:32,480
Notify the police force

187
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,410
to be on standby.

188
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:33,960
Okay.

189
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:41,800
Benefactor,

190
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:42,680
they are here.

191
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:45,800
Ningning,

192
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:47,000
eat something first.

193
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,280
Dad is going out to meet someone.

194
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,120
You are not.

195
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,810
No matter what happens,

196
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,680
I will always be your dad.

197
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,120
Chengrui.

198
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:00,880
Are you here

199
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:02,490
to arrest me?

200
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,600
I wouldn't dare.

201
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,400
You

202
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,480
have a gun in your pocket.

203
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:09,200
If you are really here to arrest me

204
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:11,360
so you can go back and clear your name,

205
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,240
just do it.

206
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:22,440
Sir,

207
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,800
if you hadn't saved me back then,

208
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,920
when I was wrongly imprisoned,

209
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,560
I would have ended my life.

210
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:29,600
But today,

211
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:31,200
I realized something.

212
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:32,520
Back then,

213
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,560
when I broke into Shengfaxi Winery,

214
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:37,360
Marshal Duan's men beat me up

215
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,880
and threw me into prison.

216
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,640
Actually,

217
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:41,760
Marshal Duan was trying to save me.

218
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:42,560
Otherwise,

219
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:44,280
the one poisoned by potassium cyanide

220
00:10:44,280 --> 00:10:46,240
and buried under the yellow earth

221
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,160
would definitely be me.

222
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:47,960
What's wrong?

223
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,570
Do you regret it?

224
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:51,040
I saved you,

225
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,280
and you've done so much for me.

226
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:54,040
Do you know what you've gained?

227
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,730
Do you feel wronged?

228
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:57,840
No.

229
00:10:58,520 --> 00:10:59,920
I chose this path myself,

230
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,000
and I killed those people.

231
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,600
I just have to bear all the consequences.

232
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,960
I bid you farewell here.

233
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,600
Take care, sir.

234
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:11,240
Have you thought it through?

235
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,600
If you turn back now,

236
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,720
you will surely die.

237
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,410
Siyao treats me as her senior brother,

238
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:24,920
and has repeatedly advised me to turn back.

239
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:27,600
Recently, I've seen these young people

240
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:30,120
sparing no effort in solving cases,

241
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:33,440
even risking their lives to do so.

242
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,880
I ask myself,

243
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:39,200
why did I become a police officer back then?

244
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,200
Sir,

245
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,440
let me go.
